ion>&#160;</span></td><td style="background-color:#cceeff;border-bottom:3pt double #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"/></tr><tr style="height:3pt"><td colspan="15" style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000;padding:0 1pt"/></tr></table></div><div style="padding-left:22.5pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">(1)</span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:8.24pt">The Company recorded $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-5" decimals="-3" sign="-" name="us-gaap:MarketableSecuritiesUnrealizedGainLoss" scale="3" id="f-553">15</ix:nonFraction> thousand and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-1" decimals="-3" sign="-" name="us-gaap:MarketableSecuritiesUnrealizedGainLoss" scale="3" id="f-554">39</ix:nonFraction> thousand unrealized losses for the three and six months ended June&#160;30, 2026, respectively. In comparison, the Company recorded $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-6" decimals="-3" name="us-gaap:MarketableSecuritiesUnrealizedGainLoss" scale="3" id="f-555">12</ix:nonFraction> thousand and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-7" decimals="-3" name="us-gaap:MarketableSecuritiesUnrealizedGainLoss" scale="3" id="f-556">64</ix:nonFraction> thousand unrealized gains for the three and six months ended June&#160;30, 2025, respectively. The unrealized (losses) gains of the mutual fund are included in </span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">other income</span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"> in the Consolidated Statements of Income.</span></div></ix:continuation></ix:nonNumeric><div id="icc12479603ee4ff7834127d591d2c10e_43"></div><div st